<</Title(A population-based multi-agent framework for simulating large-scale system dynamics with decision models in discrete environments)/Subject<>/Keywords(simulation framework, cellular automata, multi-agent systems, decision models, population dynamics)/Author(Tim Peko)/Creator(Typst 0.15.1)/ModDate(D:20261117104318+01'00)/CreationDate(D:20261117104318+01'00)>>
